# The backend runs as a Lambda (see src/lambda.ts): this file is NOT read
# at runtime in production, since it never ships in lambda.zip and the
# CI/CD workflow does not inject values into the function. All production
# values (including non-secret ones like CORS_ORIGIN/APP_BASE_URL if they
# differ from .env.defaults) must be set directly on the Lambda function's
# environment variables (console, CLI, or IaC) and are the single source
# of truth there — do not add real values to this file. This file is only
# here so that a confused engineer may search for a production environment,
# find this file, and then be redirected to the correct spot.
